==Match officials==
On April 14, 2025, FIFA confirmed that 117 match officials from 41 member associations would be selected for the tournament. This included 35 referees, 58 assistant referees, and 24 video match officials.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://inside.fifa.com/refereeing/news/match-officials-appointed-landmark-club-world-cup-2025 |title=Match officials appointed for landmark FIFA Club World Cup 2025 |publisher=Fédération Internationale de Football Association |website=FIFA.com |date=April 14, 2025 |access-date=April 14, 2025 |archive-date=April 14, 2025 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250414172614/https://inside.fifa.com/refereeing/news/match-officials-appointed-landmark-club-world-cup-2025 |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |url=https://digitalhub.fifa.com/m/7f4d476ed23d02df/original/FIFA-Club-World-Cup-2025-List-of-appointed-FIFA-Match-Officials.pdf |title=FIFA Club World Cup 2025 – List of Appointed FIFA Match Officials |publisher=Fédération Internationale de Football Association |website=FIFA.com |date=April 14, 2025 |access-date=April 14, 2025 |archive-date=April 14, 2025 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250414164250/https://digitalhub.fifa.com/m/7f4d476ed23d02df/original/FIFA-Club-World-Cup-2025-List-of-appointed-FIFA-Match-Officials.pdf |url-status=live }}</ref>

