==Knockout stage==
{{main|2025 FIFA Club World Cup knockout stage}}

In the knockout stage, if the scores were equal when normal playing time expired, [[Overtime (sports)#Association football|extra time]] was played for two periods of 15 minutes each. This was followed, if required, by a [[Penalty shoot-out (association football)|penalty shootout]] to determine the winners.<ref name="regulations"/>

